{"3570350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Silkgrove", "steam_appid": 3570350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/91f31366114b78670d1d549503770818.avif?t=1786591967\" width=1560 height=528 /></span><br><strong>Silkgrove</strong> is an open-world game set in a post-apocalyptic environment following a war between humans and machines. In the game, you take on the role of Annie, a young Restorer equipped with a set of tools and a mission to help rebuild the  world using sustainable practices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix things, craft new items, and explore to uncover stories from each place you visit. You can decorate your  home camp, meet interesting characters, and learn about the past world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play at your own pace, traveling through various environments, collecting resources, facing challenges, or simply camping and enjoying serene landscapes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/f545dc5d796aa0647bc589317e86a9c6.poster.avif?t=1786591967\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/f545dc5d796aa0647bc589317e86a9c6.webm?t=1786591967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/f545dc5d796aa0647bc589317e86a9c6.mp4?t=1786591967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore an Open World</strong>: Journey through a  post-apocalyptic landscape filled with unique items, resources, and past world secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collecting and Scavenging</strong>: Gather materials and salvage items from the environment for your needs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and Build</strong>: Use materials to create tools, scrape for materials, and upgrade your home camp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fixing and Maintenance</strong>: Repair broken items and maintain tools to keep everything running smoothly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming</strong>: Grow  food, use hydroponics, monitor food forests, and manage resources sustainably to support your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong>: Collect and manage different resources to aid your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camp Home</strong>: Camp, customize, and upgrade your mobile camp home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Stories</strong>: Find out about the past and meet new characters.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/fd997b2acfd8a719d185d617ecd41ae7.poster.avif?t=1786591967\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/fd997b2acfd8a719d185d617ecd41ae7.webm?t=1786591967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/fd997b2acfd8a719d185d617ecd41ae7.mp4?t=1786591967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/91f31366114b78670d1d549503770818.avif?t=1786591967\" width=1560 height=528 /></span><br><strong>Silkgrove</strong> is an open-world game set in a post-apocalyptic environment following a war between humans and machines. In the game, you take on the role of Annie, a young Restorer equipped with a set of tools and a mission to help rebuild the  world using sustainable practices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix things, craft new items, and explore to uncover stories from each place you visit. You can decorate your  home camp, meet interesting characters, and learn about the past world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play at your own pace, traveling through various environments, collecting resources, facing challenges, or simply camping and enjoying serene landscapes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/f545dc5d796aa0647bc589317e86a9c6.poster.avif?t=1786591967\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/f545dc5d796aa0647bc589317e86a9c6.webm?t=1786591967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/f545dc5d796aa0647bc589317e86a9c6.mp4?t=1786591967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore an Open World</strong>: Journey through a  post-apocalyptic landscape filled with unique items, resources, and past world secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collecting and Scavenging</strong>: Gather materials and salvage items from the environment for your needs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and Build</strong>: Use materials to create tools, scrape for materials, and upgrade your home camp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fixing and Maintenance</strong>: Repair broken items and maintain tools to keep everything running smoothly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming</strong>: Grow  food, use hydroponics, monitor food forests, and manage resources sustainably to support your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong>: Collect and manage different resources to aid your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camp Home</strong>: Camp, customize, and upgrade your mobile camp home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Stories</strong>: Find out about the past and meet new characters.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/fd997b2acfd8a719d185d617ecd41ae7.poster.avif?t=1786591967\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/fd997b2acfd8a719d185d617ecd41ae7.webm?t=1786591967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/fd997b2acfd8a719d185d617ecd41ae7.mp4?t=1786591967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Become a Restorer in Silkgrove. Use your toolkit to scavenge resources, repair, build, craft, and help rebuild communities in this solarpunk world. Upgrade &amp; manage your mobile home, drive across regions, and restore balance to this post-apocalyptic world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/8398ee477